   - **Vitest running duplicate test files**: root cause was `backend/vitest.config.ts` not actually excluding `dist/` output despite Vitest's documented default excludes seemingly covering `**/dist/**` — empirically the stray `dist/src/__tests__/resolvers.test.js` was still picked up. Fixed by explicitly adding `exclude: ["**/node_modules/**", "**/dist/**"]` to the vitest config, then `rm -rf dist` to clear the stray artifacts. Verified via `npx vitest run --reporter=verbose` before/after.
